    "q-123426": {
      "dom_id": "step-q123426",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the path along the polar curve $r=2{cos}^{3}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})\\,$ for $0\\le \\theta \\le 3\\pi $ ?",
      "worked_solution": "The line integral of unity with respect to arc length over $C$ is equal to the arc length $L$ of $C,$ i.e.,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=L.\n$$\n\nIn polar coordinates, the arc length element $\\text{d}s$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{d}s=\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\nSo, for a polar curve defined as $r=r(\\theta )$ for ${\\theta }_{1}\\le \\theta \\le {\\theta }_{2},$ we have\n\n$$\nL={\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s={\\int }_{{\\theta }_{1}}^{{\\theta }_{2}}\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\nSince $r=2{cos}^{3}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})\\,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta }=-2{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3}).\n$$\n\nTherefore, the expression for our line integral is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{{\\theta }_{1}}^{{\\theta }_{2}}\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3\\pi }\\sqrt{{(2{cos}^{3}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3}))}^{2}+{(-2{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3}))}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{3\\pi }\\sqrt{{cos}^{6}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})+{cos}^{4}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3}){sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{3\\pi }{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})\\sqrt{{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})+{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{3\\pi }{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\theta }{3})\\,\\text{d}\\theta \\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-123426-a",
